# Selective edge-classification fixture, not a presentation demo.
# Demonstrates GOOD/NEUTRAL/BAD samples and a parameter-dependent reachable
# target interval for the paper Section 3.2 construction.
# Does not claim calibrated physical control or controller-quality playback.
node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle LeftAnkle,RightAnkle 3 1
example walk 0.0 ../../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk 0.5 ../../BVH/walkMoreCurve.bvh
example walk 1.0 ../../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh
expect walk spanned_axes 1
expect walk corner_coverage full
# D6 raw-sum thresholds keep classification selective: the widest-turn source
# sees GOOD, NEUTRAL, and BAD targets while tight-turn sources stay fully GOOD.
# Band shifted +5 (203/210 -> 208/215) for the C1 monotone-Hermite TimeWarp,
# which moved the registered-phase pose distances up by ~3 raw units; the
# reachable box still shrinks (to ~0.87) so the selective split is preserved.
edge walk walk
edge_phase_range walk walk 0.70 0.95 0.05 0.30
edge_config walk walk 208 215 12 60 7
